{"id": "39114", "title": "狙击手：山鹰", "author": "李建林", "category": "历史军事", "count": 46, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/39/39114.htm", "intro": "西南军区优秀狙击手——华林（猎鹰）自同伴山鹰狙杀了东南亚最大的大毒枭蝰蛇后被火箭弹炸死后心灰意冷，从而选择了转业。一个偶然的机会，他得知蝰蛇根本没死，山鹰杀死的只不过是个替身，华林再次恢复斗志，并精心策划，成功地潜入蝰蛇犯罪集团。危险无处不在，复仇成了支撑他唯一的信念。", "base": "files/article/html/39/39114", "chapters": [{"title": "第一卷 鹰折", "volume": true}, {"title": "鹰折1", "file": "3638742.html", "available": false}, {"title": "鹰折2", "file": "3638744.html", "available": false}, {"title": "鹰折3", "file": "3638745.html", "available": false}, {"title": "鹰折4", "file": "3638747.html", "available": false}, {"title": "鹰折5", "file": "3638749.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二卷 意外", "volume": true}, {"title": "意外1", "file": "3638752.html", "available": false}, {"title": "意外2", "file": "3638753.html", "available": false}, {"title": "意外3", "file": "3638754.html", "available": false}, {"title": "意外4", "file": "3638755.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三卷 生　机", "volume": true}, {"title": "生机1", "file": "3638757.html", "available": false}, {"title": "生机2", "file": "3638758.html", "available": false}, {"title": "生机3", "file": "3638759.html", "available": false}, {"title": "生机4", "file": "3638760.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四卷 泰　拳", "volume": true}, {"title": "泰拳1", "file": "3638762.html", "available": false}, {"title": "泰拳2", "file": "3638763.html", "available": false}, {"title": "泰拳3", "file": "3638764.html", "available": false}, {"title": "泰拳4", "file": "3638765.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五卷 信　心", "volume": true}, {"title": "信心1", "file": "3638767.html", "available": false}, {"title": "信心2", "file": "3638768.html", "available": false}, {"title": "信心3", "file": "3638769.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六卷 基　地", "volume": true}, {"title": "基地1", "file": "3638771.html", "available": false}, {"title": "基地2", "file": "3638773.html", "available": false}, {"title": "基地3", "file": "3638775.